$(\mathcal{X}\cup \mathcal{Y}, \mathcal{A}_1\cup {(\bigcup _{1\leq i\leq s-1}{(\varepsilon_{1i}-y)}})\cup {\varepsilon_{1s})}$, $(\mathcal{X}\cup \mathcal{Y}, \mathcal{A}_2\cup {(\bigcup _{1\leq i\leq s-1}{(\varepsilon_{2i}-y)}})\cup {\varepsilon_{2s})}$ and  $(\mathcal{X}\cup\mathcal{Y}, \mathcal{A}_3\cup {(\bigcup _{1\leq i\leq s-1}{(\varepsilon_{3i}-y)}})\cup {\varepsilon_{3s})}$ are three $S(2,4,\sum_{i=1 }^{s}{g_{i}} +4)$ designs with $b+\sum_{i=1 }^{s} {b_{i}}- (s-1)$ common blocks.
