+| demo | 1 | 13 | 13 | 1 | hand-solvable illustration |
+| easy | 2 | 61 | 305 | 15 | oracle unavailable |
+| medium | 4 | 1,021 | 86,785 | 255 | not reached |
+| hard | 5 | 4,093 | 1,395,713 | 600 | shipping candidate |
+
+`SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY = "hard"`. No preset was rejected by a local gate. The
+bare harness could not score even `easy` because the external quota was already
+exhausted.
+
+## Gate results
