+## Oracle loop
+
+These are infrastructure errors, not unsolved attempts and not hardness
+evidence. The harness aborted after exhausting its redraw allowance.
+
+| Arm | Preset | Calls | Solved attempts | Result |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---|
+| bare | easy | 4 | 0/0 | all HTTP 403 quota errors |
+| structural hint | hard | 4 | 0/0 | all HTTP 403 quota errors |
