+# arXiv 1301.4764 — three-way S(2,4,v) intersection profiles
+
+**Status:** locally verified and parked pending oracle quota. The required
+OpenRouter runs were attempted, but every redraw returned HTTP 403 “Key limit
+exceeded (total limit).” Those errors were not counted as model failures.
