- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1301.4764/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The result is not submission-ready: every oracle call returned HTTP 403 because the OpenRouter total quota is exhausted. The genuine error transcripts are retained, but no model failure or hardness verdict is claimed. No `REJECTED.md` was created because the family itself did not fail G, H, or V.
