   707	\section{conclusion}
   708	In this paper, we have obtained the complete solution of the intersection problem for three $S(2,4,v)$ designs with $v=13,16$ and $v\geq49$.\\
   709	\textbf{Proof of Theorem~\ref{1.1}:}\\
   710	 (1): By Lemma~\ref{2.1} we have $J_{3}[v]\subseteq I_{3}[v]$.\\
   711	 (2): By combining the results of Theorems~\ref{5.1}, ~\ref{5.2}, ~\ref{5.3}, ~\ref{5.5}, ~\ref{5.7}, and ~\ref{5.8} we have
   712	 $J_{3}[v]=I_{3}[v]$ for all admissible $v\geq49$.\\
   713	   (3): By Theorem~\ref{5.4}, we obtain  $I_{3}[40]\setminus\{b_{40}-15, b_{40}-14\}\subseteq J_{3}[40]$.\\
   714	   (4): It holds by Lemmas~\ref{4.1} and~\ref{4.2}.\\
   715	   (5), (6), and (7): We prove these sentences in the last section.
