The [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1301.4764) gives an exact additive construction, so G and V pass. However, Track A is unsupported and the Track B candidate was solved at every tested level:

- Easy: 2/3
- Medium: 3/3
- Hard: 2/3
- Escalated `n=6`: 2/2 scored calls

Further calls hit HTTP 403 quota errors, which were not counted. Increasing `n` only enlarges arithmetic operands; the compact route remains the same twelve-ingredient calculation.

